# A Delectable Demon (abyssea 173), the edges: a level 99 Warrior in Valkurm Dunes with The Truth Beckons completed,
# Traverser Stones 5 and 6 (two stones: `>= 1`), 4 maw quests completed (A Fluttery Fiend, A Beaked Blusterer, A Man-
# eating Mite, An Ulcerous Uragnite) (GMs), Dawn of Death available. The maw: no section (Dawn of Death available): 55.
# Dawn of Death completed (a GM; `>=` accepted): 56, finished on option 1: begun (any option). The title (a GM): the
# zone-in's 57, its update on option 1: updateEvent(the key item for 4 completed: Ivory Abyssite of Perspicacity);
# finished: it is given, completed.
lists ValkurmDunes/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger ValkurmDunes/onEventFinish/56 ValkurmDunes/onEventFinish/55 ValkurmDunes/onZoneIn/1 ValkurmDunes/onEventUpdate/57 ValkurmDunes/onEventFinish/57
